# Mark the checked-in `flatc --swift` bindings as generated so they are byte-
# for-byte the raw `flatc 25.12.19` output that ci/check-swift-flatc-drift.sh
# diffs against (a PURE byte-diff, like the Rust/Kotlin/TS flatc gates).
#
# `linguist-generated` collapses them in PR diffs. `-text` opts them out of
# any Git-side EOL/whitespace munging so the committed bytes equal flatc's
# output exactly. The companion .editorconfig disables editor trailing-
# whitespace trimming for the same path (flatc emits a trailing space after
# the file-identifier accessor; trimming it re-drifts the gate).
apps/chirp/ios/Chirp/Bridge/Generated/*.generated.swift -text linguist-generated=true
